    "notes": "One additional Talent Point from Exotic Gear",
    "history": "<p>A warrior of the Yuisa tribe from planet Andernach. After most of the tribe was slaughtered during a war of independence against the Guantuan Empire, most of the survivors sought refuge within the Republic of Maboca, the main contact of Union within the planet of Andernach. It is not uncommon for Yuisan warriors to serve as Andernachian Lancers for Union, or for some other well paying organization. Yuisan warriors believe that there is no true death, as they simply reincarnate into the tribe once their previous body perishes, resulting in a hyper aggressive warrior culture. Now most Yuisan warriors seek deaths among the stars, so that their souls may reach higher glory than ever before.</p>",
